---
import DefaultLayout from "../layouts/DefaultLayout.astro"
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<DefaultLayout>
	<section class="mt-24 space-y-8 text-slate-900">
		<h2 class="text-6xl font-bold tussilago">Contact</h2>
		<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
			お仕事やCTFのお誘いなどはお気軽にメールしてください。通常は1〜2営業日以内にお返事します。
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-xl">
			<a
				href="mailto:contact@mikio815.dev"
				class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-slate-900 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#FF4081]/70 hover:shadow-lg"
			>
				<Icon name="mdi:email-outline" class="text-4xl text-[#FF4081]" />
				<div>
					<p class="futura text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">Email</p>
					<p class="futura text-2xl">contact@mikio815.dev</p>
				</div>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/social"
				class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-slate-900 shadow-sm transition hover:border-[#FF4081]/70 hover:shadow-lg"
			>
				<Icon name="mdi:share-variant" class="text-4xl text-[#FF4081]" />
				<div>
					<p class="futura text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">Social</p>
					<p class="futura text-2xl">SNSや他の窓口はこちら</p>
				</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</DefaultLayout>
